ards uses the theme system while shared/Cards ignores it. Unify into a single component system where all cards are theme-aware by default, eliminating the Themed- prefix as redundant.\",\"reasoning\":\"Having two parallel card systems creates confusion about which to use. The 'shared' cards are actually just single-theme (light) cards masquerading as theme-agnostic. Making theming the default removes this false dichotomy and ensures visual consistency.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:23:37.113Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:23:37.113Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
