main value to a visual representation. Create a BadgeSchema system where badges are defined declaratively: { domain: 'findingType', values: { fact: { color: 'indigo', label: 'Fact' }}}. Generate badge components from schemas.\",\"reasoning\":\"Six badge components with identical structure but different color mappings is a maintenance burden. A schema-driven approach would make adding new badge types trivial, ensure consistency, and enable dynamic badge generation for user-defined categories.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:23:42.601Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:23:42.601Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
[2026-01-30T00:23:46.427Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_013rZqpgWboHJDwdX4MdHQQE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PKqZ83zDKWuvSFi2vKpsVi","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/ideas -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d \"{\\\"scan_id\\\":\\\"95ff9afb-ea4d-4a6a-843a-e343d44f0969\\\",\\\"project_id\\\":\\\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\\\",\\\"context_id\\\":\\\"ctx_1769727798577_zneo2y1\\\",\\\"scan_type\\\":\\\"insight_synth\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"user_benefit\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Color Is Semantic Not Decorative\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The color prop appears throughout (success/warning/danger/default) but is used inconsistently. Create a SemanticColorContext that defines what colors mean in research context: high confidence=emerald, low confidence=red, contradiction=rose, gap=violet. Components consume semantic intents not raw colors.\\\",\\\"reasoning\\\":\\\"Currently components independently decide color meanings. This creates inconsistency - is amber warning or medium confidence? A semantic color system would ensure that 'danger' means the same thing everywhere and enable global color scheme customization.\\\",\\\"effort\\\":5,\\\"impact\\\":8,\\\"risk\\\":3}\"","description":"Create idea 3: Semantic Color System"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":365,"cache_read_input_tokens":119630,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":365},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"85342634-1965-492c-9f1e-d1725e8835fd"}
[2026-01-30T00:23:51.052Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PKqZ83zDKWuvSFi2vKpsVi","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"idea\":{\"id\":\"351ea368-786a-489f-ba94-b086eeef90bc\",\"scan_id\":\"95ff9afb-ea4d-4a6a-843a-e343d44f0969\",\"project_id\":\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727798577_zneo2y1\",\"scan_type\":\"insight_synth\",\"category\":\"user_benefit\",\"title\":\"Color Is Semantic Not Decorative\",\"description\":\"The color prop appears throughout (success/warning/danger/default) but is used inconsistently. Create a SemanticColorContext that defines what colors mean in research context: high confidence=emerald, low confidence=red, contradiction=rose, gap=violet. Components consume semantic intents not raw colors.\",\"reasoning\":\"Currently components independently decide color meanings. This creates inconsistency - is amber warning or medium confidence? A semantic color system would ensure that 'danger' means the same thing everywhere and enable global color scheme customization.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:23:47.398Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:23:47.398Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"7b1a9d4c-082c-4d9c-959b-9a0f9da9abcf","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\"idea\":{\"id\":\"351ea368-786a-489f-ba94-b086eeef90bc\",\"scan_id\":\"95ff9afb-ea4d-4a6a-843a-e343d44f0969\",\"project_id\":\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727798577_zneo2y1\",\"scan_type\":\"insight_synth\",\"category\":\"user_benefit\",\"title\":\"Color Is Semantic Not Decorative\",\"description\":\"The color prop appears throughout (success/warning/danger/default) but is used inconsistently. Create a SemanticColorContext that defines what colors mean in research context: high confidence=emerald, low confidence=red, contradiction=rose, gap=violet. Components consume semantic intents not raw colors.\",\"reasoning\":\"Currently components independently decide color meanings. This creates inconsistency - is amber warning or medium confidence? A semantic color system would ensure that 'danger' means the same thing everywhere and enable global color scheme customization.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:23:47.398Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:23:47.398Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
[2026-01-30T00:23:51.471Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_013rZqpgWboHJDwdX4MdHQQE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01P2VZ4F7rzbH8HHGzehpc7R","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/ideas -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d \"{\\\"scan_id\\\":\\\"95ff9afb-ea4d-4a6a-843a-e343d44f0969\\\",\\\"project_id\\\":\\\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\\\",\\\"context_id\\\":\\\"ctx_1769727798577_zneo2y1\\\",\\\"scan_type\\\":\\\"insight_synth\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"maintenance\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"ThemeStyles Object Is A Design Token System\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The themeStyles object in ThemeContext.tsx is an embryonic design token system. Formalize it: extract to a dedicated tokens file, add CSS custom properties generation, enable runtime theme switching without re-render. Make tokens the single source of truth for all visual properties.\\\",\\\"reasoning\\\":\\\"The current inline themeStyles object works but is tightly coupled to React context. A proper token system would enable: CSS-only theme switching, design tool integration, automated accessibility contrast checking, and easier theme creation.\\\",\\\"effort\\\":6,\\\"impact\\\":8,\\\"risk\\\":4}\"","description":"Create idea 4: Formalize Design Tokens"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":365,"cache_read_input_tokens":119630,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":365},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"e2abaa85-53e2-470b-a40d-73b447163a63"}
[2026-01-30T00:23:55.883Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01P2VZ4F7rzbH8HHGzehpc7R","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"idea\":{\"id\":\"8f6ca958-49da-4367-89f2-52afc4909613\",\"scan_id\":\"95ff9afb-ea4d-4a6a-843a-e343d44f0969\",\"project_id\":\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727798577_zneo2y1\",\"scan_type\":\"insight_synth\",\"category\":\"maintenance\",\"title\":\"ThemeStyles Object Is A Design Token System\",\"description\":\"The themeStyles object in ThemeContext.tsx is an embryonic design token system. Formalize it: extract to a dedicated tokens file, add CSS custom properties generation, enable runtime theme switching without re-render. Make tokens the single source of truth for all visual properties.\",\"reasoning\":\"The current inline themeStyles object works but is tightly coupled to React context. A proper token system would enable: CSS-only theme switching, design tool integration, automated accessibility contrast checking, and easier theme creation.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:23:52.419Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:23:52.419Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"adcb4132-b738-4d72-8992-753af162a3c0","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\"idea\":{\"id\":\"8f6ca958-49da-4367-89f2-52afc4909613\",\"scan_id\":\"95ff9afb-ea4d-4a6a-843a-e343d44f0969\",\"project_id\":\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727798577_zneo2y1\",\"scan_type\":\"insight_synth\",\"category\":\"maintenance\",\"title\":\"ThemeStyles Object Is A Design Token System\",\"description\":\"The themeStyles object in ThemeContext.tsx is an embryonic design token system. Formalize it: extract to a dedicated tokens file, add CSS custom properties generation, enable runtime theme switching without re-render. Make tokens the single source of truth for all visual properties.\",\"reasoning\":\"The current inline themeStyles object works but is tightly coupled to React context. A proper token system would enable: CSS-only theme switching, design tool integration, automated accessibility contrast checking, and easier theme creation.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:23:52.419Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:23:52.419Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
